    <item>
      <title>RAWdemption 0.9.18</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:54:25 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.18</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Flicking quickly through photos no longer develops every photo you skip past.</li><li>Slides and fades between edited photos use much less graphics work.</li><li>Less background work while you adjust white balance and detail, and while the pointer rests on the adjustment panel.</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://hobocow.github.io/rawdemption/downloads/RAWdemption-0.9.18.zip" length="2611087" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="qQZOD+3BPaF79V2X18Ug1JIGmzoqrEZJ1/r6JnNMOjyEG0v2b5uQcKGXOpvVL4cwCJBrq2Cip/CHTdrMmNfSDQ=="/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>RAWdemption 0.9.17</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:27:54 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>21</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.17</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Saving an edit now updates its thumbnail without rendering the photo again.</li><li>Tone sliders no longer trigger a second refinement pass when the image is already sharp.</li><li>Opening a photo is quicker: controls are prepared when you reach for them instead of in advance.</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://hobocow.github.io/rawdemption/downloads/RAWdemption-0.9.17.zip" length="2601558" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ahJdrx3GFT5d4ccMfcwlF/QANaa2gHGquSndYbeffmrcGtZ7B47yvp4v9jDc2fru+nOP4V43dfF3L8HPWY1QCg=="/>
